#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "Spielordner"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Windows (registry, saves, settings)"
msgstr "Windows (Registry, Spielstände, Einstellungen)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:224
msgctxt "web"
msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "Dieser Ordner ist leer"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:235
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Larger than 8 MB: too large to change here"
msgstr "Größer als 8 MB: zu groß, um sie hier zu ändern"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "Nicht angezeigt: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "UTF-8 mit BOM"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:254
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "Westlich (ein Byte je Buchstabe)"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr ""
"%s · %s-Zeilenenden · %d Zeilen · %s. Gespeichert, wie sie war: gleiche "
"Kodierung und Zeilenenden. Ein Spiel liest sie beim nächsten Start."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Schließen"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Gespeichert."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:273
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "Schließen, ohne die Änderungen zu speichern?"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr ""
"Wine schreibt seine .reg-Dateien, während ein Spiel läuft: ändere sie nur, "
"wenn kein Spiel läuft."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:280
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "Nicht geöffnet: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:283
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr ""
"Nur Textdateien (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg und ähnliche) bis 8 MB. Der "
"Dateimanager der Konsole ändert sie auch, Zeile für Zeile."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:294
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "Noch keine Spiele."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:297
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB-Laufwerk"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "kann nicht starten"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Einstellungen: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Neuestes Log"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Problem melden"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Lädt das neueste Log herunter und öffnet das ausgefüllte Formular auf "
"GitHub: Häng das Log dort an."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Startoptionen (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:316
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"Die erste Zeile, die nicht leer und kein Kommentar (# oder ;) ist, wird an "
"die Befehlszeile des Programms angehängt."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Umgebungsvariablen (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Ein NAME=Wert pro Zeile, gesetzt, bevor das Spiel startet."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Zusätzliches Logging (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:322
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Nur wenn ein Issue danach fragt, zum Beispiel err+all,+seh. Leere es "
"danach: Es macht das Spiel langsamer."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:327
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Die Spiele wurden nicht geladen: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:340
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "Keine Logs aufbewahrt."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:344
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "hatte ein Problem"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:347
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Die Logs wurden nicht geladen: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:356
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "die Verbindung wurde unterbrochen"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:373
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sending %d of %d: %s"
msgstr "Sende %d von %d: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:377
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Stopped at %s: %s"
msgstr "Angehalten bei %s: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:384
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sent %d files (%s). PC5 asks to install the game in a moment."
msgstr ""
"%d Dateien gesendet (%s). PC5 fragt gleich, ob das Spiel installiert "
"werden soll."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:393
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Type the game's folder name first (no / or \\)."
msgstr "Gib zuerst den Ordnernamen des Spiels ein (ohne / oder \\)."

#~ msgid "Keep changing"
#~ msgstr "Weiter ändern"

#~ msgid "Vibration, light bar and triggers"
#~ msgstr "Vibration, Lichtleiste und Trigger"

#~ msgid "Off. On holds the game at 30 fps and shows 60"
#~ msgstr "Aus. An hält das Spiel bei 30 fps und zeigt 60"
